 "description": "The Cisco Catalyst 6506, 6506-E, 6509 and 6509-E Switches with Wireless Services Module (WiSM) provide unparalleled security, mobility, redundancy, centralized control and scalability for large-scale Government and Enterprise wireless LAN networks and supports the IEEE 802.11i wireless security standard in conjunction with meeting the Wi-Fi Alliances interoperability specification WPA2 to enable a Secure Wireless Architecture. The module supports voice, video and data services, location & asset tracking, integrated intrusion detection & intrusion protection and intelligent radio.",
 "hardware_versions": "Chassis: 6506, 6506-E, 6509 and 6509-E; Backplane: Hardware Versions 1.0 (6506-E), 1.1 (6509-E) and 3.0 (6506, 6509); Supervisor Blade: Hardware Versions: 4.1 (SUP720-3B) and 4.0 (SUP720-3BXL); WiSM: Hardware Version 1.2",
